@startuml
title UC-04 - View Deployment Result (Main Flow)

autonumber
hide footbox

actor Developer
boundary "Web UI" as UI
control "Deployment Query API / Controller" as API
control "Deployment Query Service" as QueryService
entity "Deployment Repository" as DeploymentRepo
entity "Resource Instance Repository" as ResourceRepo
entity "Workload Instance Repository" as WorkloadInstanceRepo
participant "CD Integration / CD Status Provider" as CDStatusProvider <<interface>>
control "Concrete CD Provider" as CDProvider
participant "CD System" as CDSystem
participant "Workload Status Provider /\nKubernetes Adapter" as WorkloadProvider <<interface>>
participant "Kubernetes Cluster" as Kubernetes
control "Deployment Result Aggregator" as Aggregator

Developer -> UI: Open application and select Deployments
UI -> API: listDeployments(applicationId)
API -> QueryService: listDeployments(applicationId)
QueryService -> DeploymentRepo: findByApplication(applicationId)
DeploymentRepo --> QueryService: Deployment history
QueryService --> API: Deployment history
API --> UI: Display deployment history

Developer -> UI: Select a deployment
UI -> API: getDeploymentDetail(deploymentId)
API -> QueryService: getDeploymentDetail(deploymentId)

QueryService -> DeploymentRepo: getDeploymentDetail(deploymentId)
DeploymentRepo --> QueryService: Deployment Record, environment, target,\nApplication Definition version and catalog version
QueryService -> DeploymentRepo: getDeploymentProgress(deploymentId)
DeploymentRepo --> QueryService: Deployment progress by wave and component
QueryService -> DeploymentRepo: getDeploymentImages(deploymentId)
DeploymentRepo --> QueryService: Actual workload images and versions,\nselected or cascaded, and removed components
QueryService -> WorkloadInstanceRepo: findWorkloadInstances(applicationId,\nenvironment, target)
WorkloadInstanceRepo --> QueryService: Currently running workload deployment per workload\n(is this deployment still the running one?)
note right of WorkloadInstanceRepo
  Progress is read from persisted steps; who writes them
  and when is deferred (D4). Guards for the live CD and
  Kubernetes calls below are deferred (D2); this change
  adds no new external call.
end note
QueryService -> ResourceRepo: getInfrastructureStatus(infrastructureReferences)
ResourceRepo --> QueryService: Infrastructure status
QueryService -> CDStatusProvider: getCDStatus(deliveryReference)
CDStatusProvider -> CDProvider: getStatus(deliveryReference)
CDProvider -> CDSystem: Query deployment/sync status
CDSystem --> CDProvider: CD status
CDProvider --> CDStatusProvider: CD status
CDStatusProvider --> QueryService: CD status
QueryService -> WorkloadProvider: getWorkloadStatus(target, workloads)
WorkloadProvider -> Kubernetes: Query workload health and endpoints
Kubernetes --> WorkloadProvider: Workload status
WorkloadProvider --> QueryService: Workload health
QueryService -> WorkloadProvider: getDeploymentEndpoints(target, workloads)
WorkloadProvider -> Kubernetes: Query exposed endpoints
Kubernetes --> WorkloadProvider: Endpoints
WorkloadProvider --> QueryService: Deployment endpoints

QueryService -> Aggregator: aggregate(deploymentRecord, version, progress, images,\nworkloadInstances, infrastructureStatus, cdStatus, workloadStatus, endpoints)
Aggregator --> QueryService: Deployment result view model
QueryService --> API: Deployment result
API --> UI: Display environment, target, version, catalog version, images (selected or cascaded),\nremoved components, progress by wave, infrastructure, CD status,\nworkload health and endpoints

opt Deployment failed (A1)
  UI -> API: getDeploymentFailureDetail(deploymentId)
  API -> QueryService: getDeploymentFailureDetail(deploymentId)
  QueryService -> DeploymentRepo: getDeploymentFailureDetail(deploymentId)
  DeploymentRepo --> QueryService: Failed deployment_step rows (status,\nrelated_component_reference, error_summary)\nand deployment_record.error_summary
  QueryService --> API: Deployment failure detail
  API --> UI: Failed step, related component and error summary
end

UI --> Developer: Show deployment result

@enduml
